At 900, record flex:1 will fill remaining left height; good.

Need `.scene-column` with record flex:1 but no set height? In grid row height determined by docket panel height 100% of main? `.main` has flex:1 and min-height:0; grid items stretch to row height = main height. `.docket-panel` height 100%; `.scene-column` stretch; record flex:1 fills. Good.

